{"audio": "2timothy-02.opus", "duration_ms": 181799, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3560, "text": "2 Timothy, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 4921, "end_ms": 8881, "text": "You therefore, my child, be strong in the grace that is in Christ Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 9261, "end_ms": 16482, "text": "And the things that you have heard me say among many witnesses, entrust these to faithful men who will be qualified to teach others as well."}, {"start_ms": 17262, "end_ms": 20542, "text": "Join me in suffering, like a good soldier of Christ Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 21202, "end_ms": 27083, "text": "A soldier refrains from entangling himself in civilian affairs, in order to please the one who enlisted him."}, {"start_ms": 27683, "end_ms": 32343, "text": "Likewise, a competitor does not receive the crown unless he competes according to the rules."}, {"start_ms": 33023, "end_ms": 36404, "text": "The hardworking farmer should be the first to partake of the crops."}, {"start_ms": 37044, "end_ms": 41104, "text": "Consider what I am saying, for the Lord will give you insight into all things."}, {"start_ms": 41884, "end_ms": 51265, "text": "Remember Jesus Christ, raised from the dead, descended from David, as proclaimed by my gospel, for which I suffer to the extent of being chained like a criminal."}, {"start_ms": 51765, "end_ms": 53646, "text": "But the word of God cannot be chained!"}, {"start_ms": 54146, "end_ms": 62567, "text": "For this reason I endure all things for the sake of the elect, so that they too may obtain the salvation that is in Christ Jesus, with eternal glory."}, {"start_ms": 63607, "end_ms": 78648, "text": "This is a trustworthy saying: If we died with Him, we will also live with Him; if we endure, we will also reign with Him; if we deny Him, He will also deny us; if we are faithless, He remains faithful, for He cannot deny Himself."}, {"start_ms": 79688, "end_ms": 87849, "text": "Remind the believers of these things, charging them before God to avoid quarreling over words, which succeeds only in leading the listeners to ruin."}, {"start_ms": 88669, "end_ms": 95110, "text": "Make every effort to present yourself approved to God, an unashamed workman who accurately handles the word of truth."}, {"start_ms": 95990, "end_ms": 103331, "text": "But avoid irreverent, empty chatter, which will only lead to more ungodliness, and the talk of such men will spread like gangrene."}, {"start_ms": 104071, "end_ms": 108131, "text": "Among them are Hymenaeus and Philetus, who have deviated from the truth."}, {"start_ms": 108671, "end_ms": 113072, "text": "They say that the resurrection has already occurred, and they undermine the faith of some."}, {"start_ms": 114072, "end_ms": 129214, "text": "Nevertheless, God’s firm foundation stands, bearing this seal: “The Lord knows those who are His,” and, “Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord must turn away from iniquity.” A large house contains not only vessels of gold and silver,"}, {"start_ms": 129294, "end_ms": 130914, "text": "but also of wood and clay."}, {"start_ms": 131794, "end_ms": 135414, "text": "Some indeed are for honorable use, but others are for common use."}, {"start_ms": 135934, "end_ms": 144855, "text": "So if anyone cleanses himself of what is unfit, he will be a vessel for honor: sanctified, useful to the Master, and prepared for every good work."}, {"start_ms": 145775, "end_ms": 153516, "text": "Flee from youthful passions and pursue righteousness, faith, love, and peace, together with those who call on the Lord out of a pure heart."}, {"start_ms": 154336, "end_ms": 159437, "text": "But reject foolish and ignorant speculation, for you know that it breeds quarreling."}, {"start_ms": 160117, "end_ms": 166357, "text": "And a servant of the Lord must not be quarrelsome, but must be kind to everyone, able to teach, and forbearing."}, {"start_ms": 166917, "end_ms": 173718, "text": "He must gently reprove those who oppose him, in the hope that God may grant them repentance leading to a knowledge of the truth."}, {"start_ms": 174498, "end_ms": 180339, "text": "Then they will come to their senses and escape the snare of the devil, who has taken them captive to his will."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 2460, "si": 0}, {"t": "Timothy,", "s": 2460, "e": 2800, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3000, "e": 3340, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 3440, "e": 3560, "si": 0}, {"t": "You", "s": 4921, "e": 5021, "si": 1}, {"t": "therefore,", "s": 5081, "e": 5521, "si": 1}, {"t": "my", "s": 5621, "e": 5761, "si": 1}, {"t": "child,", "s": 5861, "e": 6201, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 6241, "e": 6321, "si": 1}, {"t": "strong", "s": 6441, "e": 6841, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 6881, "e": 6961, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6981, "e": 7061, "si": 1}, {"t": "grace", "s": 7121, "e": 7441, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 7481, "e": 7621, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 7661, "e": 7761, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 7841, "e": 7941, "si": 1}, {"t": "Christ", "s": 8041, "e": 8381, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jesus.", "s": 8421, "e": 8881, "si": 1}, {"t": "And", "s": 9261, "e": 9361, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 9401, "e": 9461, "si": 2}, {"t": "things", "s": 9541, "e": 9901, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 9941, "e": 10081, "si": 2}, {"t": "you", "s": 10121, "e": 10221, "si": 2}, {"t": "have", "s": 10261, "e": 10381, "si": 2}, {"t": "heard", "s": 10421, "e": 10581, "si": 2}, {"t": "me", "s": 10621, "e": 10681, "si": 2}, {"t": "say", "s": 10801, "e": 10961, "si": 2}, {"t": "among", "s": 11041, "e": 11261, "si": 2}, {"t": "many", "s": 11301, "e": 11461, "si": 2}, {"t": "witnesses,", "s": 11541, "e": 12121, "si": 2}, {"t": "entrust", "s": 12501, "e": 13001, "si": 2}, {"t": "these", "s": 13081, "e": 13421, "si": 2}, {"t": "to", "s": 13461, "e": 13541, "si": 2}, {"t": "faithful", "s": 13641, "e": 14021, "si": 2}, {"t": "men", "s": 14041, "e": 14241, "si": 2}, {"t": "who", "s": 14301, "e": 14382, "si": 2}, {"t": "will", "s": 14402, "e": 14522, "si": 2}, {"t": "be", "s": 14542, "e": 14602, "si": 2